00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:42.200
That's right, using this pollen, Anpanman, go to the goat old man in Konahiki and get the best wheat.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:53.600
I can make a new friend.

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:57.860
Please look forward to it.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.940
It's a present for Melonpanna-chan.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:29.880
It's a present for Melonpanna-chan.

