00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:26.500
It means that the person who created Anpanman's friends has created Baikinman's friends.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.310
I see.

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:31.580
But it looks fun!

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:34.020
Master Mie, where is that Baikinson?

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:49.640
