00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:59.270
The spirit that is about to relax immediately...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.920
I'm sweating, so I'm going to train.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.530
It's already in my head.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.460
Idiot, you're taking too much.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:26.330
Come on, let's go.

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.590
And then, the nose is...

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.400
Good guts!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:10.720
