00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.080
Give it to me, too.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.500
Hey, hey, hey, stop it!

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:28.680
Hey, hey, hey, stop it!

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:07.900
Yoisho! Yoisho! Yoisho! Yoisho!

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.120
Yoishi, Batako, put in the feces of the magocoro.

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:12.760
Yes!

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:20.590
Now we can play a game.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.550
You'll become a good friend of Melonpana-chan.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:29.220
We can be friends, but...

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:33.930
For me, she's like my little sister.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.050
Oh, that sounds fun.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.820
Let's get along with each other.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:38.320
Yeah!

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:40.680
You forgot about us.

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:42.320
Hahaha.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:44.800
I'm sorry.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.820
All right, let's let her lie down for a while.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.800
