00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.330
Of course.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:07:59.050
Actually,

00:07:59.480 --> 00:07:59.520
What?

00:07:59.520 --> 00:07:59.980
Thank you for watching.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.960
