00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:12.020
I see.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:16.300
I did a good job.

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:28.850
It's a small amount, but it's a good one.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.660
I can't wait to see what kind of bad guy the new role-panther will become!

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:50.400
That's strange. I don't think he's in a good condition.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:53.080
It looks like he's having a bad night's sleep.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.340
Did you raise the temperature a little?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:55.580
Right?

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:56.120
Yeah

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:56.500
Uncle

