00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:18.650
Panna Onee-chan!

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.410
I'm Melonpanna.

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.140
I'm looking forward to getting in.

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:24.140
Let's get along well.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:26.130
Let's play together.

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:41.570
