00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:46.340
Let's wake him up when it's done.

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:47.840
Hmm...

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:49.990
Even so, today...

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:53.290
