00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:47.470
Oh, my goodness!

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:48.660
I'm so nervous!

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:50.890
Oh, my goodness!

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:55.330
