00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.300
Hmm...

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.180
Cheer up!

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.220
Even if you have a strong power of the Valkyrie now,

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.870
you will always have the power of the Magokoro-Soul in Doll Panda-chan.

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:59.540
That's right. If you talk to her well, she'll notice.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:04.720
That's right! Like Melonpanna-chan, let's believe in Dollpanna-chan!

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.170
