00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:26.680
That's why we'll cooperate and defeat Anpanman.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.160
Anpanman.

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:31.230
I'll take care of you, too.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:43.540
What's wrong?

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.070
